{%- comment -%}
  Search suggestions shown when the search box is focused and empty (Nhóm 3 #9).
  Not placed on any template: assets/predictive-search.js fetches it once with
  `?section_id=search-discovery` (Section Rendering API). Settings: Theme settings → Search behavior.
{%- endcomment -%}
